      ms: 4720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:17gzzz0'
    female|a||For each pair, ask what else differs between the two groups besides Medicare.:
